<title>UK: Russia Securities sets $35 mln MinFin-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Russia Securities sets $35 mln MinFin-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia Securities I Inc has launched a $35 million Russian MinFin 3-linked bond, lead manager Indosuez Capital said on Monday.</p>
<p>The underlying assets for the issue are $100 million Russian MinFin tranche 3 bonds.</p>
<p>The notes will pay a coupon of 14.75-15.00 percent annually in arrears. The issue will be priced on Tuesday. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
